Package: displaymod
Version: 3.1.5
Section: APPLaunch
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: tmux, fbset, kbd, device-tree-compiler
Maintainer: H4W9 <H4W9@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Second screen for the M5Stack CardputerZero
 DisplayMOD adds a 2.8" ILI9341 SPI display (EXT display) on the EXT header.
 It mirrors the built-in screen 1:1 with a status bar in the spare rows, and
 includes BigTermCLI, a full-size terminal that runs on the EXT display.
 Settings are in the DisplayMOD launcher app or the displaymod command.
 A service (displaymod.service) loads the display driver. It runs as a
 systemd dynamic user with a few added capabilities, not as root, and the
 apps send it settings over a local socket.
